          "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}",
          "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}",
          "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}",
          "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions",
          "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs",
          "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos",
          "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}",
          "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events",
          "type": "Bot",
          "user_view_type": "public",
          "site_admin": false
        },
        "body": "Bumps [followthemoney](https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney) from 3.5.9 to 3.7.8.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/releases\">followthemoney's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v3.7.8</h2>\n<p>Important changes:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Various properties for entities on wanted lists (<code>eyeColor</code>, <code>hairColor</code>, etc.)</li>\n<li>Country codes are now more ISO (esp. Sark, various former small island countries, Kurdistan)</li>\n<li>New IDs: <code>giiNumber</code> (from IRS), NPI validation</li>\n<li><code>programId</code> and <code>programUrl</code> on <code>Sanction</code></li>\n<li>Max property value lengths adopted in many places</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Always use an array for extends and edge.caption by <a href=\"https://github.com/arp242\"><code>@​arp242</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1488\">alephdata/followthemoney#1488</a></li>\n<li>Bump uuid and <code>@​types/uuid</code> in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1483\">alephdata/followthemoney#1483</a></li>\n<li>Bump ts-jest from 29.1.4 to 29.1.5 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1482\">alephdata/followthemoney#1482</a></li>\n<li>Bump docker/build-push-action from 5 to 6 by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1475\">alephdata/followthemoney#1475</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@​types/node</code> from 20.14.2 to 20.14.10 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1489\">alephdata/followthemoney#1489</a></li>\n<li>Bump typescript from 5.4.5 to 5.5.3 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1490\">alephdata/followthemoney#1490</a></li>\n<li>Bump lint-staged from 15.2.5 to 15.2.7 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1480\">alephdata/followthemoney#1480</a></li>\n<li>Bump braces from 3.0.2 to 3.0.3 in /docs by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1473\">alephdata/followthemoney#1473</a></li>\n<li>Bump prettier from 3.3.1 to 3.3.2 in /docs by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1487\">alephdata/followthemoney#1487</a></li>\n<li>Bump replace-in-file from 7.2.0 to 8.0.1 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1478\">alephdata/followthemoney#1478</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@​typescript-eslint/eslint-plugin</code> from 7.12.0 to 7.14.1 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1477\">alephdata/followthemoney#1477</a></li>\n<li>Bump prettier from 3.3.1 to 3.3.2 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1476\">alephdata/followthemoney#1476</a></li>\n<li>[Snyk] Upgrade <code>@​alephdata/followthemoney</code> from 3.6.1 to 3.6.3 by <a href=\"https://github.com/pudo\"><code>@​pudo</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1474\">alephdata/followthemoney#1474</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@​typescript-eslint/parser</code> from 7.12.0 to 7.14.1 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1481\">alephdata/followthemoney#1481</a></li>\n<li>Persons properties for wanted lists by <a href=\"https://github.com/pudo\"><code>@​pudo</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1496\">alephdata/followthemoney#1496</a></li>\n<li>Documentation schema: use array for extends by <a href=\"https://github.com/arp242\"><code>@​arp242</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1497\">alephdata/followthemoney#1497</a></li>\n<li>Remove trailing whitespace and double spaces, update translation files by <a href=\"https://github.com/arp242\"><code>@​arp242</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1498\">alephdata/followthemoney#1498</a></li>\n<li>Bump rimraf from 5.0.7 to 6.0.1 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1510\">alephdata/followthemoney#1510</a></li>\n<li>Bump prettier from 3.3.2 to 3.3.3 in /docs by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1499\">alephdata/followthemoney#1499</a></li>\n<li>Bump typescript from 5.5.3 to 5.5.4 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1504\">alephdata/followthemoney#1504</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@​alephdata/followthemoney</code> from 3.6.3 to 3.6.4 in /docs by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1500\">alephdata/followthemoney#1500</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@​types/node</code> from 20.14.10 to 22.0.2 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1507\">alephdata/followthemoney#1507</a></li>\n<li>Max typed value length metadata by <a href=\"https://github.com/pudo\"><code>@​pudo</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1516\">alephdata/followthemoney#1516</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@​typescript-eslint/parser</code> from 7.16.0 to 7.18.0 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1503\">alephdata/followthemoney#1503</a></li>\n<li>Bump prettier from 3.3.2 to 3.3.3 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1505\">alephdata/followthemoney#1505</a></li>\n<li>Bump replace-in-file from 8.0.1 to 8.1.0 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1509\">alephdata/followthemoney#1509</a></li>\n<li>Bump rollup from 4.18.0 to 4.20.0 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1512\">alephdata/followthemoney#1512</a></li>\n<li>Bump ts-jest from 29.1.5 to 29.2.4 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1508\">alephdata/followthemoney#1508</a></li>\n<li>Add lobbyist topic by <a href=\"https://github.com/pudo\"><code>@​pudo</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1513\">alephdata/followthemoney#1513</a></li>\n<li>Recently introduced field by <a href=\"https://github.com/pudo\"><code>@​pudo</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1517\">alephdata/followthemoney#1517</a></li>\n<li>Override max length for individual props by <a href=\"https://github.com/pudo\"><code>@​pudo</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1519\">alephdata/followthemoney#1519</a></li>\n<li>Bump ts-jest from 29.2.4 to 29.2.5 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1520\">alephdata/followthemoney#1520</a></li>\n<li>Bump lint-staged from 15.2.7 to 15.2.9 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1521\">alephdata/followthemoney#1521</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@​types/node</code> from 22.0.2 to 22.5.0 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1522\">alephdata/followthemoney#1522</a></li>\n<li>Bump rollup from 4.20.0 to 4.21.0 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1525\">alephdata/followthemoney#1525</a></li>\n<li>Bump micromatch from 4.0.5 to 4.0.8 in /docs by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1524\">alephdata/followthemoney#1524</a></li>\n<li>Bump path-to-regexp from 6.2.1 to 6.3.0 in /docs by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1535\">alephdata/followthemoney#1535</a></li>\n<li>Bump dset from 3.1.3 to 3.1.4 in /docs by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1534\">alephdata/followthemoney#1534</a></li>\n<li>Bump <code>@​alephdata/followthemoney</code> from 3.6.4 to 3.7.1 in /docs by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1533\">alephdata/followthemoney#1533</a></li>\n<li>Bump rollup from 4.21.0 to 4.21.2 in /js by <a href=\"https://github.com/dependabot\"><code>@​dependabot</code></a> in <a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/pull/1528\">alephdata/followthemoney#1528</a></li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/5ae629371aef68acb2d2fbea02536063913ad981\"><code>5ae6293</code></a> Bump version: 3.7.7 → 3.7.8</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/234f457355d8deea4147d037bc77763f43e6e7b0\"><code>234f457</code></a> update</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/ccb1e353b9c459a4c69a359a22d70d53f1c675fc\"><code>ccb1e35</code></a> Sanction program metadata, small model fixes (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/issues/1590\">#1590</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/98532059db8c4333f52ca7852fa7a20c23c00ed2\"><code>9853205</code></a> Bump version: 3.7.6 → 3.7.7</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/53f71a3c49b658b47b743580fbca31860b2b6294\"><code>53f71a3</code></a> IRS GIIN ID (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/issues/1589\">#1589</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/e02c99723a8cb269d2a0eb7212a0c1a44f378ec8\"><code>e02c997</code></a> allow to write packages</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/8f025d9b594f0c7e38844d148ddb3cd67aa0dc90\"><code>8f025d9</code></a> Bump version: 3.7.5 → 3.7.6</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/cc475b22e17646ad0dad4321941940a3192cf9dc\"><code>cc475b2</code></a> authorize pypi via workflow federation</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/e59c152781f67287c1a8336f88ea82e7909b3182\"><code>e59c152</code></a> Bump version: 3.7.4 → 3.7.5</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/commit/6c1594cf2548f0a7d20602773b777837341801dd\"><code>6c1594c</code></a> re-generate the model</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a href=\"https://github.com/alephdata/followthemoney/compare/v3.5.9...v3.7.8\">compare view</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\n[![Dependabot compatibility score](https://dependabot-badges.githubapp.com/badges/compatibility_score?dependency-name=followthemoney&package-manager=pip&previous-version=3.5.9&new-version=3.7.8)](https://docs.github.com/en/github/managing-security-vulnerabilities/about-dependabot-security-updates#about-compatibility-scores)\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't alter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting `@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits that have been made to it\n- `@dependabot merge` will merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot squash and merge` will squash and merge this PR after your CI passes on it\n- `@dependabot cancel merge` will cancel a previously requested merge and block automerging\n- `@dependabot reopen` will reopen this PR if it is closed\n- `@dependabot close` will close this PR and stop Dependabot recreating it. You can achieve the same result by closing it manually\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all of the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop Dependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>",
